        <main>
            <h2>Welcome to Our Platform</h2>
            <p>This platform aims to reduce food waste by connecting food retailers, consumers, and charitable organizations. Join us today to start making a difference!</p>
            <h3>Why Food Waste Matters</h3>
            <p>Every year, millions of tons of food are wasted around the world, contributing to economic losses and significant environmental damage, including greenhouse gas emissions and unnecessary water usage. Our platform seeks to address these issues head-on.</p>
            <h3>How You Can Help</h3>
            <p>Whether you are a retailer with surplus food, a consumer wanting to make ethical purchasing decisions, or a charitable organization that distributes food to those in need, there is a role for everyone in the fight against food waste.</p>
            <h3>Our Features</h3>
            <p>Our platform offers a variety of features designed to make it easy for you to contribute to food waste reduction:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Retailers can manage and report their surplus food easily.</li>
                <li><strong>Smart Matching:</strong> We connect the surplus food inventories of retailers with the needs of charitable organizations in real-time.</li>
                <li><strong>User Alerts:</strong> Get notified about surplus food availability or requests based on your preferences and location.</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Success Stories</h3>
            <p>Join the thousands who have already made a significant impact. From small bakeries to large supermarket chains, our community is growing every day. Read their stories on our blog and see how simple actions can lead to major changes.</p>
            <h3>Get Involved</h3>
            <p>Becoming part of our platform is easy. Simply register, choose your role, and start making a difference today. Together, we can reduce food waste and create a more sustainable future.</p>
        </main>
